WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.482 --> 00:00:05.411
Today’s task: cover 47, then name its neighbors.

2
00:00:05.411 --> 00:00:07.284
Tap a cell to cover it with a star.

3
00:00:07.284 --> 00:00:10.366
Say 1 more and 10 more. The handle bar checks you.

4
00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:13.234
Cover 37 and 57 too: 10 less and 10 more.

5
00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:16.995
Tap the stars again to uncover and check.

6
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:20.505
Multiples of 6 shades every sixth number.

7
00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:24.533
Start at sets the first number, for 101 to 200.

8
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:30.843
Hold the handle bar for its wheel. Boards start locked.

9
00:00:30.843 --> 00:00:37.797
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
